          "snippet": {
            "text": "def AlphaEqns (X b N : ℕ) : Prop :=\n  ∃ r s t u v w x y : ℕ, 3 < b ∧ u ^ 2 + t ^ 2 = 1 + b * u * t ∧\n    s ^ 2 + r ^ 2 = 1 + b * s * r ∧ r < s ∧ u ^ 2 ∣ s ∧ v + 2 * r = b * s ∧\n    w % v = b % v ∧ w % u = 2 % u ∧ 2 < w ∧ x ^ 2 + y ^ 2 = 1 + w * x * y ∧\n    2 * X < u ∧ 2 * X < v ∧ x % v = X % v ∧ 2 * N < u ∧ x % u = N % u",
